{"_id":"6986e85a711cf3c91280a0fc","title":"Basic UI Library","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aad2855dc597aca7f3c3924e7039b7e60926608c619cf8a1fd61f3b70c289ad9.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1770448986202.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aad2855dc597aca7f3c3924e7039b7e60926608c619cf8a1fd61f3b70c289ad9.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1770448986202.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Basic-UI-Library-107168","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":1306,"executes":420,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a4bb851250c2b090d9c18a63ab0ac02ae2e4e125e3edfa20cabd7e5544710fc3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1770448986202.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1770448986202.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a4bb851250c2b090d9c18a63ab0ac02ae2e4e125e3edfa20cabd7e5544710fc3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1770448986202.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1770448986202.png"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-02-07T07:23:06.225Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-07T07:23:06.225Z","lastBump":"2026-02-07T07:23:06.225Z","script":"local Library = loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/deedlemcdoodledeedlemcdoodle-creator/SpectravaxHub/main/uilibrary.lua\"))()\n\nLibrary:SetTheme(\"Dark\") --[[Heres every Themes!\nNebula\nObsidian\nAurora\nEclipse\nCarbon\nEmber\nGlacier\nVolt\nNova\nAether]]\n\nlocal Window = Library:CreateWindow(\"Basic Interface Suite\", \"aperture\")\n\nWindow:Label(\"SpectravaxISBACK\")\n\nWindow:CopyLabel(\"Copy this thingy\", \"You copied it\")\n\nWindow:Button(\"Click Me!\",function()\n    print(\"u clicked that\")\nend)\n\nWindow:Slider(\"Slider (Work In Progress!)\", 1, 100, 50, function(v)\n    print(\"Value: \" .. v)\nend)\n\nlocal options = {}\nfor i = 1, 30 do\n    table.insert(options, \"Option \" .. i)\nend\n\nWindow:Dropdown(\"Choose an Option\", options, function(selected)\n    print(\"Selected: \" .. selected)\nend)","features":"Basic Interface Suite\n\n​Basic is a sleek, lightweight, and high-performance UI library designed for developers who prioritize a clean aesthetic and executor compatibility. Despite the name, it features a robust theme system and full Lucide icon support.\n\n​Key Features\n\n​Universal Compatibility: Uses gethui and custom parenting to ensure the UI works across all major executors without being detected by standard GUI scanners.\n\n​Theme System: Has over 10+ Themes\nNebula\nObsidian\nAurora\nEclipse\nCarbon\nEmber\nGlacier\nVolt\nNova\nAether\n\n​Lucide Icons: Integrated icon support pulled directly from a centralized asset table for a professional look.\n\n​Optimized Elements: Features interactive sliders with smooth dragging mechanics, animated buttons, and persistent labels.\n\n​Static Presence: ResetOnSpawn is disabled to ensure your interface stays on screen after character resets.\n​Technical Details\n\n​Library Name: Basic\n​File Name: uilibrary.lua\n​Design Philosophy: Minimalist and Compact\n\nMade by:\n\nSpectravaxISBACK/deedlemcdoodledeedlemcdoodle-creator\n\nEternie/coolMANdude-3\n\nYou can check our document website here: https://deedlemcdoodledeedlemcdoodle-creator.github.io/","tags":["RobloxScript","Spectravax","UI Library","Basic","Basic Interface Suite"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"66226f79b630f5f9659c491b","username":"SpectravaxISBACK","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e118d439cdd5adee11ad9b612ea5fb90b7582c0b14ad24f5cf8143062affb637.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66226f79b630f5f9659c491b-1769790023790.png"},"status":"offline","id":"66226f79b630f5f9659c491b","topMilesto